SUMMARY:MYO Toy Drive
DESCRIPTION:Our St. Rafka MYO is hosting a toy drive to support children 
 in foster care for Christmas this year through Macomb Foster Closet. New
  & unwrapped toys for any age (infant - teenager) can be dropped off in 
 the donation bin in the social hall starting Sunday\, October 25th. Plea
 se no used toys\, and no nerf guns or similar toys. Toys will be collect
 ed until Thursday\, December 3rd. Please contact Linda Akouri\, Rania Ay
 oub\, or the church office with any questions.
END:VEVENT
